oaxaca-desktop (4.0.4+git20261013-0oaxaca2) stonking; urgency=medium

  * oaxaca-desktop depends on ffmpegthumbnailer, so Files shows video
    thumbnails out of the box; it moved from the optional
    oaxaca-desktop-apps, which keeps evince and gnome-disk-utility.
  * Drop the Suggests on intel-media-va-driver-non-free:
    oaxaca-session depends on it since 0.1.4.

